      "updated": 1784311052170,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Ops (yaml configurations and infrastructure as code via terraform/kubernetes/airflow && linux cli to ssh)\n    - Ci/CD (delivery, deployment) + CT\n        - Ci: tests (unit, integration, end-to-end)\n        - CD: strategies\n            - blue-green\n            - canary\n        - CT: drift\n            - online vs. offline\n            - real-world, data\n    - containerization (resourcing efficiency, and reproducibility)\n        - enviornment, os, versioning, dependencies, code\n            - package managers (uv, pip, homebrew, npm)\n                - conda (anaconda vs. miniconda. vs miniforge)\n    - Security\n        -Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures (CVE)\n            - Grype (a container and dependency vulnerability scanner by Anchore)\n\n    - Observability\n        - logging\n        - monitoring\n\n    - Supporting refactors to improve and maintain code/data quality\n        - delint, duplicates, dead code, redundancy \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ops (yaml configurations and infrastructure as code via terraform/kubernetes/airflow && linux cli to ssh)\n    - Ci/CD (delivery, deployment) + CT\n        - Ci: tests (unit, integration, end-to-end)\n        - CD: strategies\n            - blue-green\n            - canary\n        - CT: drift\n            - online vs. offline\n            - real-world, data\n    - containerization (resourcing efficiency, and reproducibility)\n        - enviornment, os, versioning, dependencies, code\n            - package managers (uv, pip, homebrew, npm)\n                - conda (anaconda vs. miniconda. vs miniforge)\n    - Security\n        -Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures (CVE)\n            - Grype (a container and dependency vulnerability scanner by Anchore)\n\n    - Observability\n        - logging\n        - monitoring\n\n    - Supporting refactors to improve and maintain code/data quality\n        - delint, duplicates, dead code, redundancy \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
